            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f4" n="4" xml:id="d138-f4-content">
                <p>Loomis placed a vertical line in the
                    right-hand margin next to this paragraph and wrote “agree” to the right of
                    it.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f5" n="5" xml:id="d138-f5-content">
                <p>Dunlap wrote “(Henry Dunlap)” below his typed initials.</p>
            </note>
